This document also uses terms defined in the OGC Standard for Modular specifications (https://portal.opengeospatial.org/files/?artifact_id=34762[OGC 08-131r3]), also known as the &apos;ModSpec&apos;. The definitions of terms such as standard, specification, requirement, and conformance test are provided in the ModSpec.

