</li>
<li id="_98ebe9a1-f533-fbc3-ae11-6988e1c185e8"><fmt-name id="_48cdb0a8-8a94-9948-f57a-6416d998a4bf">—</fmt-name><p id="_a6367a69-452f-6c8e-9981-dec8e19d2577" semx-id="_a6367a69-452f-6c8e-9981-dec8e19d2577"><link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/601" id="_c20c6158-157c-944b-c1cc-d2890c05b0b8"/><fmt-link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/601"/></p>
