<ul id="_10fa1064-a2d0-267b-c738-ba665ebfe3eb" semx-id="_10fa1064-a2d0-267b-c738-ba665ebfe3eb"><li id="_f28b9c15-8c9a-2e95-9b7a-da9069b8556f"><fmt-name id="_fc809bea-5031-38ef-3c49-c0fc15565e11">—</fmt-name><p id="_8b1f90b0-796b-b740-fb9a-92715ba571db" semx-id="_8b1f90b0-796b-b740-fb9a-92715ba571db"><link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/584" id="_e2194d6c-1a27-8300-a746-d5b4aeb2638f"/><fmt-link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/584"/></p>
</li>
