<p id="_37c80694-d329-6439-fe09-bd463f5500cb" semx-id="_37c80694-d329-6439-fe09-bd463f5500cb">GeoSPARQL 3D should provide the opportunity to extrude 2D geometries to 3D geometries and vice versa.</p>

