<p id="_e432cb5e-79c3-b31e-de14-3a26dd88aa0f" semx-id="_e432cb5e-79c3-b31e-de14-3a26dd88aa0f"><strong>Category</strong></p>

<p id="_f3860e1c-ce43-9985-8ab8-8ed390e93ee7" semx-id="_f3860e1c-ce43-9985-8ab8-8ed390e93ee7">Semantic improvement</p>

<p id="_ea918664-873c-2f59-4ee0-dd14b9a031f0" semx-id="_ea918664-873c-2f59-4ee0-dd14b9a031f0"><strong>Description</strong></p>

<p id="_8b4710ed-66dd-be08-92d1-55a408f5d18b" semx-id="_8b4710ed-66dd-be08-92d1-55a408f5d18b">GeoSPARQL 3D should provide functions and properties that describe essential properties of a 3D Geometry such as its minimum and maximum height, width and depth and its CompactnessRatio.</p>

<p id="_7078aab3-02f2-8091-ba1f-f5a1e12ff1d6" semx-id="_7078aab3-02f2-8091-ba1f-f5a1e12ff1d6"><strong>Related work</strong> - CGAL → SFCGAL → PostGIS - BIMSPARQL</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_9918cdd2-cc5c-fc78-bc91-dffa2153b2e2" obligation="normative" semx-id="_9918cdd2-cc5c-fc78-bc91-dffa2153b2e2">
<title id="_fd1bf360-e7c9-9627-7af6-269dd8ece570" semx-id="_06cdbbe9-e698-1065-0b31-c3b8cb2f108d">Extension 12: Non-topological Query Functions — 3D Extension</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_985c10e6-aa94-8180-0062-5b08d3f518aa"><span class="fmt-caption-label">10<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>12<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_fd1bf360-e7c9-9627-7af6-269dd8ece570">Extension 12: Non-topological Query Functions — 3D Extension</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 10<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>12</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_1c6fd6d1-1d37-1910-0f62-469f457168f0" semx-id="_1c6fd6d1-1d37-1910-0f62-469f457168f0"><strong>Github Issue URI</strong></p>

<ul id="_e593aaf8-a85c-51a1-9914-bfac601d4f3a" semx-id="_e593aaf8-a85c-51a1-9914-bfac601d4f3a"><li id="_d52c0588-3706-fd2e-ae2b-279ea6723f15"><fmt-name id="_114f05bf-6e3f-209e-f44a-76ced235e3c0">—</fmt-name><p id="_8d6469e5-bbe4-04c5-5902-545eba24b509" semx-id="_8d6469e5-bbe4-04c5-5902-545eba24b509"><link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/556" id="_e9b0850e-271e-7d80-5355-27dfeae4815e"/><fmt-link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/556"/></p>
</li>
</ul>

<p id="_708217ff-a227-1590-0c16-cca34736e68d" semx-id="_708217ff-a227-1590-0c16-cca34736e68d"><strong>Category</strong></p>

<p id="_84a583cb-69f3-34a3-9356-6cec930a56b9" semx-id="_84a583cb-69f3-34a3-9356-6cec930a56b9">Semantic improvement</p>

<p id="_1d371ad3-89d9-3a48-8ce0-b5a41ceffab3" semx-id="_1d371ad3-89d9-3a48-8ce0-b5a41ceffab3"><strong>Description</strong></p>

<p id="_adf68951-d301-bc43-48a9-e05afb38c51a" semx-id="_adf68951-d301-bc43-48a9-e05afb38c51a">GeoSPARQL 3D should provide the opportunity to execute non-topological query functions on 2D and 3D geometries commonly used in geospatial databases. Proposed extensions include following functions:</p>

<ul id="_a1e5cd51-6410-1f80-f96d-380963f479a2" semx-id="_a1e5cd51-6410-1f80-f96d-380963f479a2"><li id="_e648d055-71f8-01d9-c6e5-13af5afebded"><fmt-name id="_3665ac22-4cff-9988-9c14-441ea269e691">—</fmt-name><p id="_75123b45-8df1-1e0a-73d5-980417d7639e" semx-id="_75123b45-8df1-1e0a-73d5-980417d7639e">geometry extrusion to the specified line segment</p>
</li>
<li id="_5f931ad1-1cef-fe7f-a54e-28f31ee050c8"><fmt-name id="_ab0399ab-2594-6817-b4c9-c59f149c185e">—</fmt-name><p id="_56415078-fd53-dae7-0144-d1f954cb2245" semx-id="_56415078-fd53-dae7-0144-d1f954cb2245">geometry extrusion to the specified height</p>
</li>
<li id="_10885132-eba5-1287-83ed-028e190922b9"><fmt-name id="_65071733-36b7-a456-8b4f-36e6aa3cb7e1">—</fmt-name><p id="_8f18976d-38a0-7a31-16f2-ef11a02d3e31" semx-id="_8f18976d-38a0-7a31-16f2-ef11a02d3e31">spatiotemporal geometry extrusion to the specified line segment with specific start and end time</p>
</li>
</ul>

<p id="_de9e461d-5dff-8a4e-e03f-118ddf96cab3" semx-id="_de9e461d-5dff-8a4e-e03f-118ddf96cab3"><strong>Related work</strong> - CGAL → SFCGAL → PostGIS - BIMSPARQL - stSPARQL</p>
</clause>

<clause id="_1de30a83-8f52-1b63-bc5c-ccf64c235b21" obligation="normative" semx-id="_1de30a83-8f52-1b63-bc5c-ccf64c235b21">
<title id="_d5f152d2-985e-fb9a-ef26-6f37d7953a9f" semx-id="_903c1089-211d-66a9-7b6e-90f59339389c">Extension 13: 3D Geometry available in Open BIM (IFC)</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_92c78289-ff3e-8caf-a8b7-3abf2a724b2b"><span class="fmt-caption-label">10<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>13<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_d5f152d2-985e-fb9a-ef26-6f37d7953a9f">Extension 13: 3D Geometry available in Open BIM (IFC)</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Clause</span> 10<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>13</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_9bc4c57f-199f-e2b9-a7c7-e21150cc330b" semx-id="_9bc4c57f-199f-e2b9-a7c7-e21150cc330b"><strong>Github Issue URI</strong></p>

<ul id="_14422199-9b4a-65e0-e02b-2f02fec35569" semx-id="_14422199-9b4a-65e0-e02b-2f02fec35569"><li id="_9701690a-2145-0e58-380b-37e70ffc0f28"><fmt-name id="_81ad0f40-bad9-959b-d1f6-239d4dc0fd02">—</fmt-name><p id="_d57e3fcf-e3e6-2669-c269-5d6d129c6ebc" semx-id="_d57e3fcf-e3e6-2669-c269-5d6d129c6ebc"><link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/8" id="_069db666-3493-ea52-1be0-9da1d6635912"/><fmt-link target="https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogc-geosparql/issues/8"/></p>
