<p id="_951b6273-f0da-1a29-8953-0c70a566b3a8" semx-id="_951b6273-f0da-1a29-8953-0c70a566b3a8"><strong>Category</strong></p>

<p id="_8f619bea-dedc-0b84-f0e7-703f6b25aa62" semx-id="_8f619bea-dedc-0b84-f0e7-703f6b25aa62">Semantic improvement</p>

<p id="_33e3cef3-993b-eda1-1731-5a867e6b7ddb" semx-id="_33e3cef3-993b-eda1-1731-5a867e6b7ddb"><strong>Description</strong></p>

<p id="_1394b4b7-d4de-2c0a-2a52-a403efe24645" semx-id="_1394b4b7-d4de-2c0a-2a52-a403efe24645">GeoSPARQL 3D should provide means to assess ratios between geometry properties. Proposed function comparing percentage area ratio will be useful in AECO industry use cases such as measuring ratio of total floor area of a building to land parcel area for compliance checking. The function allows to compare ratios of 2D area with surface area of 3D geometries apart from measuring area ratios for geometries of the same dimensionality.</p>

<p id="_3426ed4f-eb01-ddbf-29f1-337aa2170229" semx-id="_3426ed4f-eb01-ddbf-29f1-337aa2170229"><strong>Related work</strong></p>

