<p id="_1151778a-ca7b-6456-584e-109f5b0d5a53" semx-id="_1151778a-ca7b-6456-584e-109f5b0d5a53">Overview of ISO 19107 GML IFC STEP OpenCascade WKT X3D Geometries</p>

<p id="_29e1e7ff-768c-9276-dd23-b6abdf9ecabc" semx-id="_29e1e7ff-768c-9276-dd23-b6abdf9ecabc">This overview of geometry types shows which geometry types are similar to one another. It is not a 10% match.</p>

<clause id="_fe82f158-e9f0-c939-a3df-7e09b528b0ff" obligation="informative" semx-id="_fe82f158-e9f0-c939-a3df-7e09b528b0ff" autonum="B.1">
