<p id="_a48fe8e0-5fe3-efcb-51e4-26b4b8456c73" semx-id="_a48fe8e0-5fe3-efcb-51e4-26b4b8456c73">A Point is a 0-dimensional geometric object that represents a single location in a coordinate space.</p>

