<clause id="_13b11664-ed3f-9fa3-33bf-f50c2a0d2d22" obligation="informative" semx-id="_13b11664-ed3f-9fa3-33bf-f50c2a0d2d22" autonum="B.2">
<title id="_e2dc6434-8e0d-afdf-232c-da711a2f7d4b" semx-id="_cb739411-488d-699e-e9ca-ad7dcab2c393">Lines and Curves</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_cb8ab704-3460-bbc7-b31e-dd81ebd74eb0"><span class="fmt-caption-label">B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>2<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_e2dc6434-8e0d-afdf-232c-da711a2f7d4b">Lines and Curves</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Annex</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>2</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_8545a884-b883-5a18-9837-1dc57630a096" semx-id="_8545a884-b883-5a18-9837-1dc57630a096">A Curve is an abstract geometry base class representing a 1-dimensional geometric object stored as a sequence of points.</p>

<p id="_254365a9-782f-690b-76fe-5e122529dd37" semx-id="_254365a9-782f-690b-76fe-5e122529dd37">Lines are 1-dimensional curves formed by a sequence of two or more coordinate vertices connected by straight, linearly interpolated segments.</p>

<table id="_081447e0-7a19-b3aa-83d8-b817b1cc3ea0" semx-id="_081447e0-7a19-b3aa-83d8-b817b1cc3ea0" autonum="B.2">
<name id="_5e83fd2c-daa9-45e3-047d-f3df1fdd4598" semx-id="_edce1f13-ff3a-0d7e-00c8-567854dc238b">Alignment of Lines and Curves</name><fmt-name id="_43978384-2caa-f1d5-cf38-57df767c5fc4"><span class="fmt-caption-label"><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>2</span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"> — </span><semx element="name" source="_5e83fd2c-daa9-45e3-047d-f3df1fdd4598">Alignment of Lines and Curves</semx></fmt-name><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Table</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>2</fmt-xref-label>
