<clause id="_b9632e62-af1b-6c18-8854-3e582ccd9f0d" obligation="informative" semx-id="_b9632e62-af1b-6c18-8854-3e582ccd9f0d" autonum="B.4">
<title id="_2c5db331-4194-a4c1-df66-ea3b9e1bf6f9" semx-id="_87fd92df-e98c-ed2b-6080-960abac5177f">Primitives</title><fmt-title depth="2" id="_a251714a-d27c-9fad-7b96-54042a71d466"><span class="fmt-caption-label">B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span></span><span class="fmt-caption-delim"><tab/></span><semx element="title" source="_2c5db331-4194-a4c1-df66-ea3b9e1bf6f9">Primitives</semx></fmt-title><fmt-xref-label><span class="fmt-element-name">Annex</span> B<span class="fmt-autonum-delim">.</span>4</fmt-xref-label>
<p id="_e56a9704-cfe0-ca22-e831-9a54ce752800" semx-id="_e56a9704-cfe0-ca22-e831-9a54ce752800">A primitive (like a block or ellipsoid) can be defined with just a few parameters. It is more efficient than describing the same shape with triangles (mesh) or surfaces (B-rep). It keeps files smaller and mathematically exact.</p>

<table id="_c0287998-e025-7718-de6b-f082ac14275f" semx-id="_c0287998-e025-7718-de6b-f082ac14275f" autonum="B.4">
