<p id="_103acc7d-cbcc-f1fe-5373-41d01f3e1cfb" semx-id="_103acc7d-cbcc-f1fe-5373-41d01f3e1cfb">A solid is a topological object that encloses a region of space and a shell is a set of connected surfaces that form a boundary. A Solid is a closed shell.</p>

