<td id="_d3528881-d131-c71f-c1e3-fd79de444b75" valign="middle" align="left" semx-id="_d3528881-d131-c71f-c1e3-fd79de444b75"><tt>IfcGeometricRepresentationContext.Precision</tt> Model-level precision and tolerances that influence how geometry is interpreted and when elements are considered coincident. Only linear tolerance, no angular setting and no local (e.g per-vertex) possibilities.</td>
